{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0red-hot\u00a0sparks,\u00a0laser\u00a0swords\u00a0and\u00a0rocket-propelled\u00a0fists,\u00a0a\u00a0modern\u00a0Mecha\u00a0fighting\u00a0game\u00a0finally\u00a0appears!\u00a0Iron\u00a0Saga,\u00a0Game\u00a0Duchy's\u00a0mech-themed\u00a0mobile\u00a0game,\u00a0spins\u00a0off\u00a0into\u00a0its\u00a0Versus\u00a0version:\u00a0Iron\u00a0Saga\u00a0VS!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As\u00a0a\u00a0modern\u00a0fighting\u00a0game,\u00a0it\u00a0features\u00a0robust\u00a0<strong>rollback</strong>\u00a0online\u00a0play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=NEW\u00a0AND\u00a0CLASSIC\u00a0MECHA!=</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12\u00a0powerful\u00a0mechs\u00a0are\u00a0at\u00a0your\u00a0disposal\u00a0to\u00a0pilot,\u00a0including\u00a0some\u00a0from\u00a0classic\u00a0anime\u00a0series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<strong>[Mazinger\u00a0Z\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazinger\u00a0Z</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great\u00a0Mazinger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss\u00a0Borot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Shin\u00a0Getter\u00a0Robo\u00a0Armageddon\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getter\u00a0Robo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Super\u00a0Beast\u00a0Machine\u00a0God\u00a0Dancouga\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancouga</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Iron\u00a0Saga\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vassago</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaguya</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qing\u00a0Long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Susanoo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mephisto</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wu\u00a0Shuang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nero</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/e27972bf3b43c3daa571954321dd2251.poster.avif?t=1770821127\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/e27972bf3b43c3daa571954321dd2251.webm?t=1770821127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/e27972bf3b43c3daa571954321dd2251.mp4?t=1770821127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=ARSENAL\u00a0SYSTEM=</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0playable\u00a0mechs\u00a0in\u00a0Iron\u00a0Saga\u00a0VS\u00a0can\u00a0be\u00a0outfitted\u00a0with\u00a0one\u00a0of\u00a0two\u00a0unique <strong>Arsenals</strong>,\u00a0altering\u00a0their\u00a0special\u00a0move\u00a0list\u00a0and\u00a0dramatically\u00a0changing\u00a0their\u00a0gameplay.\u00a0Will\u00a0you\u00a0use\u00a0Mazinger\u00a0Z's\u00a0missile\u00a0arsenal\u00a0&quot;Bat\u00a0A\u00a0Thousand&quot;\u00a0or\u00a0his\u00a0photon\u00a0power\u00a0eye\u00a0beam\u00a0charged\u00a0&quot;Photon\u00a0Power\u00a0Commands&quot;?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/a65e620ec7b8855a388510b74ec1c044.poster.avif?t=1770821127\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/a65e620ec7b8855a388510b74ec1c044.webm?t=1770821127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/a65e620ec7b8855a388510b74ec1c044.mp4?t=1770821127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=<strong>POWERFUL\u00a0COMBOS\u00a0AND\u00a0SUPERMOVES</strong>=\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill\u00a0your\u00a0<strong>EN</strong>\u00a0bar\u00a0in\u00a0combat\u00a0to\u00a0use\u00a0your\u00a0stronger\u00a0Energy\u00a0Moves,\u00a0take\u00a0advantage\u00a0of\u00a0<strong>Flash\u00a0Counters</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0unleash\u00a0powerful\u00a0combos\u00a0and\u00a0unleash\u00a0your\u00a0<strong>Power\u00a0Max\u00a0Supermove</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0finish\u00a0your\u00a0opponent\u00a0off!\u00a0But\u00a0in\u00a0dire\u00a0times,\u00a0you\u00a0also\u00a0have\u00a0access\u00a0to\u00a0your\u00a0<strong>Awakening\u00a0Supermove</strong>...\u00a0will\u00a0it\u00a0be\u00a0enough\u00a0to\u00a0turn\u00a0the\u00a0tides\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0battle?\u00a0Many\u00a0control\u00a0options\u00a0also\u00a0allow\u00a0for\u00a0basic\u00a0combos\u00a0to\u00a0be\u00a0easily\u00a0accessible\u00a0to\u00a0players\u00a0of\u00a0all\u00a0skill\u00a0levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/288654e6a8822b31f150a28861f36d50.poster.avif?t=1770821127\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/288654e6a8822b31f150a28861f36d50.webm?t=1770821127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/288654e6a8822b31f150a28861f36d50.mp4?t=1770821127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=ADVENTURE\u00a0ON\u00a0WITH\u00a0YOUR\u00a0FAVORITE\u00a0MECHA=</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover\u00a0the\u00a0lore\u00a0behind\u00a0your\u00a0Mecha\u00a0and\u00a0its\u00a0pilot\u00a0in\u00a0Arcade\u00a0Mode,\u00a0fulfill\u00a0your\u00a0missions'\u00a0objectives\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0increasingly\u00a0challenging\u00a0Simulacrum\u00a0Chronicle,\u00a0learn\u00a0the\u00a0best\u00a0techniques\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0Pilot\u00a0Academy\u00a0or\u00a0master\u00a0your\u00a0own\u00a0techniques\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0robust\u00a0Training\u00a0mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=COMPETE\u00a0WITH\u00a0NEW\u00a0AND\u00a0OLD\u00a0FRIENDS=</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight\u00a0against\u00a0an\u00a0AI\u00a0or\u00a0friend\u00a0offline\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0VS\u00a0mode,\u00a0or\u00a0meet\u00a0online\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0public\u00a0regional\u00a0or\u00a0private\u00a0lobby!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All\u00a0online\u00a0play\u00a0features\u00a0smooth\u00a0rollback\u00a0netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly\u00a0meet\u00a0new\u00a0opponents\u00a0in\u00a0either\u00a0casual\u00a0or\u00a0ranked\u00a0matchmaking.\u00a0Can\u00a0you\u00a0reach\u00a0the\u00a0rank\u00a0of\u00a0Grandmaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now\u00a0get\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0robot\u00a0and\u00a0fight,\u00a0Commander!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2463800?t=1770821127","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2463800?t=1770821127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/68e7c6dfa94a268812fa506744d32499c2dd96d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770821127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/68e7c6dfa94a268812fa506744d32499c2dd96d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770821127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>NOW AVAILABLE: ZEORYMER</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/0908709771d6c17aff879cb22cb337d9.avif?t=1770821127\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Saga VS - Zeorymer DLC GOES LIVE NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Heh, feel the power of the heavens with your body!'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for the Deluxe Bundle for 20% off!</p></p><br><h1>NOW AVAILABLE: SHIN GETTER ROBO DLC</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Character: Shin Getter Robo</strong> (DLC-Only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Getter-series robot developed by Dr. Saotome to protect [Shin Dragon]. Its devastating power is not to be underestimated!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras/007aa464bac9d385b43869a21d48989f.avif?t=1770821127\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463800/extras_big/007aa464bac9d385b43869a21d48989f.avif?t=1770821127 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Stage: Getter Fleet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dimension-hopping armada is encountered after Shin Getter Robo and Shin Getter Dragon unleash the [Shin Shine Spark]. Join them as they sail toward a shared destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Kept me waiting, Getter Team!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Updates</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Shin Getter Robo stages added to [Arcade Mode] and [Pilot Academy].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Shin Getter Robo Profile content (Some of them are locked to certain requirements).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Shin Getter Robo will be available throughout Single Player and Multi-Player after DLC purchase.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0red-hot\u00a0sparks,\u00a0laser\u00a0swords\u00a0and\u00a0rocket-propelled\u00a0fists,\u00a0a\u00a0modern\u00a0Mecha\u00a0fighting\u00a0game\u00a0finally\u00a0appears!\u00a0Iron\u00a0Saga,\u00a0Game\u00a0Duchy's\u00a0mech-themed\u00a0mobile\u00a0game,\u00a0spins\u00a0off\u00a0into\u00a0its\u00a0Versus\u00a0version:\u00a0Iron\u00a0Saga\u00a0VS!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As\u00a0a\u00a0modern\u00a0fighting\u00a0game,\u00a0it\u00a0features\u00a0robust\u00a0<strong>rollback</strong>\u00a0online\u00a0play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=NEW\u00a0AND\u00a0CLASSIC\u00a0MECHA!=</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12\u00a0powerful\u00a0mechs\u00a0are\u00a0at\u00a0your\u00a0disposal\u00a0to\u00a0pilot,\u00a0including\u00a0some\u00a0from\u00a0classic\u00a0anime\u00a0series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff<strong>[Mazinger\u00a0Z\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazinger\u00a0Z</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great\u00a0Mazinger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss\u00a0Borot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Shin\u00a0Getter\u00a0Robo\u00a0Armageddon\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getter\u00a0Robo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Super\u00a0Beast\u00a0Machine\u00a0God\u00a0Dancouga\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancouga</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Iron\u00a0Saga\u00a0series]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vassago</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"b